🚀 Onset Detector
A high-precision transient detection algorithm designed for real-time applications.

Peak Finding: Uses dynamic thresholding (Local Average) to accurately pinpoint musical events.

Smart Isolation: Effectively isolates transients from background noise.

Customizable: Features adjustable hysteresis (cool-down time) to prevent double-triggering.

Hardware Ready: Fully optimized for export to hardware like Pisound via RNBO.

